Olhe.

91
00:16:06,250 --> 00:16:07,416
É a rainha.

92
00:16:16,041 --> 00:16:17,250
Onde está o Charles?

93
00:17:34,375 --> 00:17:35,208
Onde estamos?

94
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:37,083
High Street, cara.

95
00:17:40,375 --> 00:17:41,208
Em Londres.

96
