Peter Crouch!

103
00:18:34,750 --> 00:18:36,750
Ele é grande, vermelho

104
00:18:36,833 --> 00:18:38,458
Seus pés passam da cama

105
00:18:38,541 --> 00:18:40,416
Peter Crouch!

106
00:18:40,500 --> 00:18:42,500
Peter Crouch!

107
