185
00:33:53,916 --> 00:33:55,708
Então, pouco tempo depois,

186
00:33:57,333 --> 00:34:01,083
as paredes sussurrariam
os feitiços do apeth.

187
00:34:04,416 --> 00:34:05,875
Das sombras...

188
00:34:08,291 --> 00:34:09,625
